              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
              "source": "UniProtKB",
              "id": "Q9UBN4"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Forms a receptor-activated non-selective calcium permeant cation channel (By similarity). Acts as a cell-cell contact-dependent endothelial calcium entry channel (By similarity). Forms a homomeric ion channel or a heteromeric ion channel with TRPC1; the heteromeric ion channel has reduced calcium permeability compared to the homomeric channel (By similarity). Also permeable to monovalent ions including sodium, lithium and cesium ions (By similarity)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "FUNCTION"
    },
