              "id": "8947038"
            }
          ],
          "value": "May be operated by a phosphatidylinositol second messenger system activated by receptor tyrosine kinases or G protein coupled receptors (By similarity). May be activated by intracellular calcium store depletion (PubMed:8947038)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "ACTIVITY REGULATION"
    },
    {
      "texts": [
        {
          "evidences": [
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
              "source": "UniProtKB",
              "id": "Q9QUQ5"
            },
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250",
              "source": "UniProtKB",
              "id": "Q9UBN4"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Homotetramer (By similarity). Heterotetramer with TRPC1 and/or TRPC5 (By similarity). Forms a heteromeric ion channel with TRPC1, with a 1:3 TRPC1:TRPC4 stoichiometry (By similarity). Interacts with TRPC4AP (By similarity). Isoform alpha but not isoform beta interacts with ITPR1, ITPR2 and ITPR3 (By similarity). Interacts with NHERF1 (By similarity). Interacts with MX1 and RNF24 (By similarity). Interacts (via CIRB domain) with SESTD1 (via the spectrin 1 repeat) and SPTBN5 (via C-terminus) (By similarity). Interacts with CDH5 and CTNNB1 (By similarity). Interacts (via protein 4.1-binding domain) with EPB41L2 (By similarity). Interacts with PLSCR1 (By similarity)"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "SUBUNIT"
    },
